    "detailed_description": "\u201cWhen you climb the tower on top of that mountain<br />\r\nHave the goddess grant her wishes &quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA frog-like rabbit is the main character's high-difficulty 2D action<br />\r\nIn order to fulfill the wish that &quot;I will not be mistaken for a frog&quot;<br />\r\nAim for the place of the goddess.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1.Use the mouse pointer to determine the direction of the jump<br />\r\n2.Press and hold the mouse to charge power<br />\r\n3.Release the mouse click to jump<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u30fb You can acquire special skills by using the \u2605 collected on the stage.<br />\r\n\u30fbBasically a stage clear type game.<br />\r\n\u30fbA formidable boss or a long stage awaits at the end of the level",
